WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Make room for what matters. Start with two active watchers. Your watchlist and history stay on this device.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose your AI provider. Open Settings. Add your own key, then review data sharing before enabling Gemini or OpenAI. AI usage is separate from Pro.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Make yourself comfortable. Choose System, Light or Dark. Use your phone’s text-size settings for a more comfortable view.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Start with a little inspiration. Choose a preset, or select Write my own to describe what you want to keep an eye on.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Be specific about updates. Set your instructions and context. Say when you want a notification. Save, then test manually before relying on automatic checks.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Two free. More with Pro. Pro removes the active-watcher limit. One purchase. No app subscription. Provider charges still apply.
